Subject: [P21 proposal] winedmo retain bounded network and origin contract

Residual against GE-Proton11-9 after ge-video-rework.
Source-reviewed only: not compiler or runtime qualification.
Prior P19b2 patch ownership (some behavior is now upstream):
  ge-master-20260913-se2-p8/0032-winedmo-classify-http-media-after-probing.patch
  ge-proton11-6-a320/0017-winedmo-propagate-terminal-network-read-errors.patch
  ge-proton11-6-a322-r2/0025-winedmo-normalize-hls-vod-timeline.patch
  ge-proton11-6-a322/0005-winedmo-stream-progressive-http-vod.patch
  ge-proton11-6/0001-winedmo-open-rtsp-over-tcp.patch
  ge-proton11-6/0002-winedmo-interrupt-network-demux-and-report-live-seekability.patch
  ge-proton11-6/0003-winedmo-use-destroy-params-for-wow64-demuxer.patch
  ge-proton11-6/0004-winedmo-async-http-and-repair-vod-seeking.patch
  ge-proton11-6/0006-winedmo-recover-interrupted-vod-seeks.patch
  ge-proton11-6/0020-quiet-ge-media-diagnostics.patch
  ge-proton11-7-se2-p19a/0068-sr2-preserve-leading-mp4-audio.patch
  ge-proton11-7-se2-p19b/0031-winedmo-open-secure-rtsp-tcp-aliases.patch
  ge-proton11-7-se2-p19b/0039-mf-report-terminal-direct-filter-errors.patch
  ge-proton11-7-se2-p19b/0061-winedmo-preserve-demuxed-video-timestamps-v2.patch
  ge-proton11-7-se2-p19b/0071-mfreadwrite-map-source-origin-metadata.patch
  ge-proton11-7-se2-p19b/0073-winedmo-use-one-network-open-budget.patch
  ge-proton11-7-se2-p19b2/0079-wine-register-presentation-origin-header.patch
  proposed/0028-winedmo-bound-published-stream-access.patch
  proposed/0029-winedmo-latch-asf-startup-timestamp-decision.patch
  proposed/0030-winedmo-check-filter-initialization-failures.patch
  proposed/0038-winedmo-describe-filter-eof-failures.patch
  proposed/0041-winedmo-allow-supported-hls-audio-containers.patch

P21 changes only ordinary seek serialization and removes unreachable
reusable-cancellation repair; Shutdown remains interruptible.
Clean component postimages only; no test observer is included.

